{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他想起过去自然亲近的日子，心里重新有了暖意和期待，也开始想把往后的日子好好过起来。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"怀念、温暖、期待、重新振作\",\n      \"missed\": \"他对未来可能长期遇不到亲近之人的担忧，以及后来决定即使没有人陪伴也要好好生活、不再为留住别人而忍受委屈。音乐从温柔到激烈、再到平静的具体变化也需要细读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他被过去的亲近回忆重新点燃了希望，但又担心以后很难再遇到这样的人，内心仍有拉扯。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"温暖、怀念、盼望、不安\",\n      \"missed\": \"他最终并不是单纯等待另一个人出现，而是决定无论有没有人重新亲近自己，都要好好生活、不再委屈自己。音乐画面从冲高到回落的情绪对应关系不容易一眼看清。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他逐渐不再执着于过去和失去的亲近关系，决定先把自己的日子过好。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"释然、孤独、克制、坚定\",\n      \"missed\": \"这个决定之前经历了重新燃起希望、害怕等待太久、逐渐安定下来的过程；他对未来亲密关系的态度也不只是放弃，而是愿意珍惜但不再勉强自己。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"左侧正文是一整块字号很大但内部没有视觉层次的长段落，人物经历、心理变化和音乐画面连续挤在一起。一眼容易抓到开头的怀念和右侧高亮的最终决定，却不容易同时抓到中间的情绪转折。右侧四条短语其实提供了清楚的情绪发展顺序，但字号较小，且只有最后一条明显突出。人物处境与感受基本能串起来，音乐画面与人物心理的对应则需要读到段落后半部分才能确认。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "71dc8194-fac5-4d07-b907-690251f0036c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T010557708633Z", "elapsed_seconds": 74.484, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:07:12.191914+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a3a6349c7856b77afc5a0e4e9838837c929a2951e38e96f6760e69a90197b0a9", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T010557708633Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "34a980de75086f492db5f4fc7029db6c2f1db992e24eb9202569d9de78715c03"}}}
